"does she keep writing these?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Ancora...? ⟪k:10⟫Un’altra lettera?!⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"Perché continua a scriverle?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B5983E94_BBC9_45BF_B0FB_1B0C2E30EB64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad116697413525c0dbd75dccb93ac80e3ffe844d9b6b4d015e8f78ee1ad5cd10
