msgid "⟪k:0⟫To Jacopo’s eyes, the modified letters looked like professions of love for another man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Agli occhi di Jacopo, le lettere modificate sembravano dichiarazioni d’amore per un altro "
"uomo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_62944463_45B4_447D_9941_303F4D8DC728
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4b3838ba4017d2843a398c105b60a659300e86ac3f5d9e8f69317c5627fb401
