msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_62944463_45B4_447D_9941_303F4D8DC728"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The more she inscribed of her feelings for Jacopo, the greater the turmoil grew within his "
"heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Più lei esprimeva i suoi sentimenti per lui,⟪k:1⟫più il tumulto nel cuore di Jacopo cresceva."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAE71367_CD0B_413F_9F18_85D94107EED6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed6a81e17a28315b5ce34480f69f19d9a5829284a33bbb2cbf47dfb6698ddabd
