msgid "⟪k:0⟫Even though her love was directed toward him..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sebbene il suo amore fosse diretto a lui..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_74677037_C960_434B_8799_3174A9E124B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
