msgid "⟪k:0⟫“I still treasure the gift you gave to me”?!⟪k:1⟫God’s sake!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫“Conservo ancora il regalo che mi hai dato”?!⟪k:1⟫Porca puttana!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABA07F0C_F921_46EC_9909_A42142880D1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
