"⟪k:0⟫(Ahh, listen to me.⟪k:1⟫Resigning myself to the hope that everything will fix itself...⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫How did I end up like this?)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Ahh, guardami.⟪k:1⟫Rassegnato alla speranza che le cose si sistemino da sole...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"Come sono arrivato a questo punto?)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_055210D6_0009_4EA9_A188_FCC724C81A56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87b7091a83f0c07c88ea1ed056c11fdf5cd664410a5af7563bdbbc9236d68812
