msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_194B39BC_4CE1_43B0_A750_4A51ED4D218C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫On the surface, Maria acted quite heartbroken at the sight of their suffering."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫In superficie, Maria sembrava molto addolorata alla vista della loro sofferenza."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7C58F6CE_3BB5_46D1_9D98_F170AA9E7258
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 969012dcffd5a28bf1fe7e51f75af5310cc8dc27c93bc68cd24e0629955026c1
#. default-sha256: db705cb26b480e7955c6eba6a31661f3b528c8375dd55c76b8af582647ec8930
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7C58F6CE_3BB5_46D1_9D98_F170AA9E7258"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But when she returned to her room, the walls echoed with her cackles. ⟪k:1⟫She derived a "
"great deal of entertainment from their squirming."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma quando tornava in camera sua, la sua risata risuonava fragorosa⟪k:1⟫tra le pareti della "
"stanza. ⟪k:2⟫Si divertiva parecchio ad assistere al loro tormento."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CB7A3857_AA78_4D07_B7B6_E02AE4675CD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76371e541e8d556e9aa1595dcaece3ba897447dc433a8c3a96770fe2c76843b1
