msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_830ADD04_45C1_4706_87D5_99FFB88E5EF6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And both the White-Haired Girl and Jacopo continued to place their "
"confidence in Maria—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫the one responsible for everything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫E sia Jacopo che la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi continuavano⟪k:5⟫a "
"riporre la loro fiducia in lei—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Maria, la responsabile di tutto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F465F1A3_FC1C_4DF5_9EA5_6575686FE7B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0867185cc4f671cc33b0babcb4914fa7b48b24095a84c9d4b5b0e9190015322
