msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mio amato,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sei ancora bloccato dal lavoro?⟪k:4⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9521FB25_384A_47B1_8307_A477AB4052A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a991600cab8a1105261a3e45332e78f8b5f2edf523dad3f038e993b30d6f0b2
#. default-sha256: 03ab6a70fd86f7cb780eced31e52c5e624fed5b052a870fc4a3deba9ee890175
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9521FB25_384A_47B1_8307_A477AB4052A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It has been some time since we last saw one another,⟪k:2⟫so I know not what you have "
"been doing of late...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I only hope you remain in good health.⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫È⟪k:3⟫ passato parecchio tempo da quando ci siamo visti l’ultima volta,⟪k:4⟫quindi "
"non so cosa tu abbia fatto di recente...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Spero solo che tu stia bene.⟪k:7⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E3071CFB_0BED_4668_BDC2_71A89B9879D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d9d902513c56d72b86cfbeaa41299008d906b61a1326bb26e20edc9fcfbf5f8
