msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I could just stop reading them.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Potrei semplicemente smettere di leggerle.)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_004E5DF0_9EA6_4EB6_858D_55E1C7416E27
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
