msgid "⟪k:0⟫(It would certainly make things easier.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Renderebbe sicuramente le cose più facili.)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D910474C_FDD5_41ED_8017_DB92FBDDF606
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
