msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C66B43D4_373A_4993_9436_ABBE96833A62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I’d be better off knowing the truth than torturing myself with fantasy.)"
msgstr ""
" ⟪k:0⟫(⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ meglio che io sappia la verità,⟪k:3⟫piuttosto che torturarmi con la fantasia.)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D2D61E49_B00D_4D43_9F8B_12009474F606
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
