msgid "⟪k:0⟫(It’s... ⟪k:1⟫the better option...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫... ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫È⟪k:5⟫ la scelta migliore...)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6ACE457C_CCD2_4718_B71F_4C6FAFE59680
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3eeea1088fd8685f511e07f1192bdaeb2ae8206efb56aba75edacf9ecc2dfb33
#. default-sha256: e4a03acd3180358a3ea3ab9beb6c3f4e778476cb03609446b7695d3f238daa57
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6ACE457C_CCD2_4718_B71F_4C6FAFE59680"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Jacopo accepted every letter Maria delivered, without fail."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Jacopo accettava ogni lettera che Maria gli portava, senza eccezioni."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7828B9FF_F8E6_4F8F_A06F_0E3CB4F58FF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83c39c697c7975cd83625e235848a96dbe1a027b7c29ed56afac74a01b25f873
#. default-sha256: 64a38f81971ac50032eca5b49d401f92f4e26dca316e99622df7e5b4f7a29a2e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7828B9FF_F8E6_4F8F_A06F_0E3CB4F58FF5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He would merely nod as he accepted it, his face contorted in discomfort, and then pore over "
"the text when he was alone."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mentre le prendeva, si sarebbe limitato ad annuire, con la faccia contorta dal disagio, e "
"poi si sarebbe concentrato sul testo non appena sarebbe rimasto da solo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_19CFD068_422C_4A7F_9260_1CE39BFEEB4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5790e3929933492fa3c41bc432f145296826a77e315db854084cc7cf2533b55
#. default-sha256: 189f73bbef6af609bd3abb34c5664ebe6721c45e85d6eae415959f11a3e2f940
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_19CFD068_422C_4A7F_9260_1CE39BFEEB4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I assume he did not want her to see his heart sinking into darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Suppongo che non volesse che Maria lo vedesse mentre il suo cuore sprofondava nell’abisso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D1D1587E_189A_45F6_8DFE_8BD627FBD823
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a02af07a6a162436a27a72efff85948ea372865011b8ec3c67a2342fcf8d0005
#. default-sha256: c5f01a13e5e9a360c051f1157ee26c344c83e06666ddd47f376bd9afa361d3c4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D1D1587E_189A_45F6_8DFE_8BD627FBD823"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Had he put his trust in his wife rather than Maria..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se avesse riposto la propria fiducia in sua moglie anziché in Maria..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_86406C83_4B36_4C3F_8CC6_F48CAD8E8C13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bb5922d86d78e515ac71489e7ac41a5d3e42d3c212bdd8615737cbb6459a7fd
#. default-sha256: 47eb69d31e9bc9a8f22b29d4afad96891918a57895859966b55a890a23618f96
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_86406C83_4B36_4C3F_8CC6_F48CAD8E8C13"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫he would have almost certainly been able to realize the letters were directed at him, "
"despite the altered recipient name."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫avrebbe sicuramente capito che le lettere erano dirette a lui, nonostante il nome modificato."

#: scenario3:scenario3_43B42520_6217_4709_AF6F_354D10551C5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a83f193560c6df4947618e2a6dd43ac9349fd52b6445ccd96948e0ee0525ef41
#. default-sha256: 68252e197cb2de3cc5a5c3eddc2bc3d642dc18a7480cf477ac7b1d97f71e0dea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_43B42520_6217_4709_AF6F_354D10551C5A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything she wrote about concerned him, after all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma ogni cosa che lei scriveva lo tormentava."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8F118727_77C2_4DE7_80CE_8D1A5127EBD4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e22bc0cf461251e6c20e4500c62f20b751ee33a3249e7b49f0d938d6a7fd18dd
#. default-sha256: ae046705cd4785d1b889bfea685dc907f726b88e4d8cc1f8660b58f2747d9441
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8F118727_77C2_4DE7_80CE_8D1A5127EBD4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫How could someone who had lived as isolated a life as her have so many identical experiences "
"with two distinct men?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Come può qualcuno che ha vissuto una vita così isolata,⟪k:1⟫avere delle esperienze tanto "
"identiche con due uomini diversi?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_110FC6C1_9CAB_4787_A205_619E20331F8D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5636a6b254aa1984020a210d044378f2bc8f0e36b25bba17fdfbc4c4dbbed75
#. default-sha256: 2a4525a4dd4d0e6518f59e8d7085ef8e23cb96d90dee61a8bf61a6bc37df17ad
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_110FC6C1_9CAB_4787_A205_619E20331F8D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why could he not find it in himself to trust her?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perhaps doubting her was simply "
"easier."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perché non riusciva a fidarsi di sua moglie?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Forse dubitare di lei era "
"semplicemente la via più facile."

#: scenario3:scenario3_02F83CA3_4101_40CE_890F_DDC2792CE5D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66f91b77b047e604be2ee86f5d9ff578603b35057cbc0eb600bfd968bd487605
#. default-sha256: 4ebc298d1bb0b1328241cd77a928ed3363b6b4a0bd79fc907120baf708010dc0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_02F83CA3_4101_40CE_890F_DDC2792CE5D2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you were in his position... ⟪k:1⟫would you trust her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Al posto di Jacopo... ⟪k:1⟫avrebbe avuto fiducia in lei, Padrone?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_35F58E7B_DAE2_401E_B9CA_4E67094F114F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 428ceda7c6711e237e0098dd9e4cbf74bada634a0725344427d521205a9844b6
#. default-sha256: c4be6e80d22e403d87df86d8bd7ba4a400066523f32bd961d553e054aa50aab9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_35F58E7B_DAE2_401E_B9CA_4E67094F114F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Would you maintain faith in her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the woman who had waited so long?⟪k:3⟫Would you "
"believe the feelings she professed for you were genuine?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avrebbe riposto la sua fede nella donna che aveva atteso così a lungo?⟪k:1⟫Avrebbe creduto "
"nella sincerità dei suoi sentimenti?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B258CCD9_53ED_4E32_B7B4_41798DF92CF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbcec0193f7d6aa52dcb9b3028e656a5e0277944e96e785962e7e82c5d1d4060
#. default-sha256: a84776cf4fc9edc5e43210de0880da2a8fe4d551a93995d2a687dea605a608e8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B258CCD9_53ED_4E32_B7B4_41798DF92CF2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She continued writing letters—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫day after day, week after week—"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫without hiatus. ⟪k:9⟫She had, by and large, run out of things to say, but that did not "
"put an end to her letter-writing; she simply repeated what she had written before."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫La donna continuò a scrivere—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫giorno dopo giorno, settimana "
"dopo settimana—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫senza interruzione. ⟪k:9⟫Aveva esaurito tutto ciò che aveva da dire, ma "
"non smise di scrivere le sue lettere; semplicemente ripeteva ciò che aveva già scritto in "
"precedenza."

#: scenario3:scenario3_78EE2711_CC0B_4F2D_B567_91BEEAE53482
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a5dfd206a662e8c2fe31e9bc21238d5b791c9f61de3756e6cf50039e5a69108
#. default-sha256: ee9c7855ed60e0f578f1037e00fa716e24c1110e3a78684827807a1a68f76747
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_78EE2711_CC0B_4F2D_B567_91BEEAE53482"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, they did not see one another in person.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The White-Haired Girl, "
"forbidden from leaving her shed,⟪k:3⟫could only wait for her husband to pay her a visit."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonostante questo, non si vedevano di persona.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi, "
"reclusa nel capanno,⟪k:3⟫poteva solo aspettare che suo marito le facesse visita."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8408EBA5_2745_4E66_9797_E6E12DEE1579
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d65d936e3e8aded714e21a664d54964bbb35e34a079e8dc0925dd38a44e5c2f
#. default-sha256: d90b194be226bf05c6d8d39fcc6d40da1aee8760531c153bd57a55cbec55cf45
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8408EBA5_2745_4E66_9797_E6E12DEE1579"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My beloved,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There is a little bit of fog out today.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Weather like this "
"reminds me of my home country.⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mio amato,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Oggi c’è un po’ di nebbia fuori.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Un tempo del genere mi "
"ricorda il mio Paese natale.⟪k:6⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_EE588D42_1756_4033_BA03_96194D2307FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aba0627ca5db1e93f04070ad19c6f64c13b3dd2adc00d4347bc77bc2f647ee84
#. default-sha256: 7b9d944e72d8c23938621129e48505be7546a2393b98374e80222ff992e76923
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE588D42_1756_4033_BA03_96194D2307FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was born on an island perpetually covered in a thick fog.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m not saying I "
"would like to return, but thinking about it does make me feel rather homesick. ⟪k:4⟫Does that "
"happen to you?⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sono nata su un’isola perennemente coperta da una fitta nebbia.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non sto "
"dicendo che vorrei tornarci, ma ripensarci mi fa venire nostalgia⟪k:4⟫di casa. ⟪k:5⟫Succede anche "
"a te?⟪k:6⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D927D0C4_01DE_4490_ADDF_462274F505D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14aabb4f707fafa4784531b7d474db4d3ac99d9ddf369605e5b0242b51468415
#. default-sha256: 0a1c68c47e97e0e133479e6b33803e693c6912045c5eaa55c62a396b63bbf429
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D927D0C4_01DE_4490_ADDF_462274F505D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That reminds me—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫aside from that one time, you have not told me much of your "
"homeland. ⟪k:4⟫It would be nice if we could pay it a visit together sometime.⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ora che ci penso—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫a parte quell’unica volta,⟪k:4⟫non mi hai detto molto della "
"tua terra.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Sarebbe bello se ci andassimo insieme qualche volta.⟪k:7⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A418DE7_22D7_4FF4_B384_F3B33B5554EE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2a83a3d5905221428f2d85f4947954256202a6472ffac6297f3f90a532cb39b
#. default-sha256: 3f2e8b34831b09d28a4cba6c582efcd044e2dfcd0a9753e4a49cd3476426f22f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9A418DE7_22D7_4FF4_B384_F3B33B5554EE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Speaking of which, before I left, an exhibition of some sort was held there.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A proposito, prima di lasciare il mio Paese, si era tenuta un’esposizione lì.⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DE47C3A5_A349_4019_A735_6CE1C9FCA621
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75ad28f0c7892fc263f48079c4fa19c1cb2fb04c16551c005cebf3dd0e553691
#. default-sha256: 1badbc286377f338ebe140d151754b36b688f76e1ca5df46f549cea84f5e1067
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DE47C3A5_A349_4019_A735_6CE1C9FCA621"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was unable to attend... ⟪k:2⟫but perhaps you had the chance when it was near you?⟪k:3⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non potei andarci... ⟪k:2⟫ma forse tu ne hai avuto l’opportunità?⟪k:3⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1E215EC3_0314_4F72_BF79_25A39094A182
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9658eaa6b1c69145a080a396822110f16bb33f1eedafdab477eb4961ded0518
#. default-sha256: 2c9c134d055e5a2ff66e6448fe26939f40e3c306b49a169a0aad5b287b7af862
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1E215EC3_0314_4F72_BF79_25A39094A182"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I imagine you would have, with your interest in new technology.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Next time you "
"have a chance, I would enjoy hearing what they had on display.⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Immagino di sì, visto il tuo interesse per le nuove tecnologie.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫La prossima "
"volta che ne avremo l’occasione,⟪k:4⟫mi piacerebbe vedere cos’hanno in mostra.⟪k:5⟫"

