msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And while I was doing that—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫giving you, a woman I had never met before, my full "
"attention—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E mentre io riservavo la mia completa attenzione a te—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫a una donna che non "
"avevo mai incontrato prima—"

