#: scenario3:scenario3_0BC53DE5_2D46_45BF_9360_BFCBD8EA10EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 905a14fe7415b87e60ecda46a42388eb1a06591dabbdda0c03a51a505b4da9f0
#. default-sha256: b027c064bf10a09ad52cf25894bf991427c85ed7fb817cee7f1b2301a142fc97
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0BC53DE5_2D46_45BF_9360_BFCBD8EA10EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had he simply stepped up and taken action,⟪k:1⟫he could have put an end to the stream of "
"letters,⟪k:2⟫each of which gave rise to further misunderstanding."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se si fosse fatto avanti prendendo in mano la situazione, avrebbe interrotto quel fiume di "
"lettere, ognuna delle quali portava ad ulteriori malintesi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_71E4F38E_1917_4891_8C16_CC927E4DD979
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a43b572fcff608e798d57a83ab7623e2835e9ef597c290f8e0b24789a5be295e
#. default-sha256: 43eac41924f47c5f286d27bf1981563c31356e1d91a13cb1e1876ce998a24d68
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_71E4F38E_1917_4891_8C16_CC927E4DD979"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He needed merely ask the White-Haired Girl in-person to whom the letters were addressed, "
"whether what they described were true, and the twisted threads of his confusion would have all "
"been unraveled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non avrebbe dovuto fare altro che chiedere di persona alla Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi a chi "
"fossero indirizzate quelle lettere, se ciò che descrivevano fosse vero, e i nodi della sua "
"confusione sarebbero stati sciolti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B27EDCA0_0BD4_4396_80E5_F308942A3E78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9dc1121b3a9e857a6beaa4881a5e2b0189ad617ef5d5d6b52d0839db6016724
#. default-sha256: a2d018abeff0fbc82a0c99cf0c50579936fa854dd0347898f3dc65586c536c48
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B27EDCA0_0BD4_4396_80E5_F308942A3E78"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But he made no such effort, relying instead on Maria to serve as his intermediary."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma non lo fece, affidandosi piuttosto a Maria, affinché fungesse da sua portavoce."

#: scenario3:scenario3_575730D3_EF40_4CB9_A37C_1A2484F91D0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae8d6197926afbdb6bc1bce24a1f98126d7805022fefed5fed3992c8e26057eb
#. default-sha256: 64d1cddc7d101d6c478b77cdc290be6d97641816fac8fa8cbb3a33f205bbe8ef
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_575730D3_EF40_4CB9_A37C_1A2484F91D0B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I feel as though I have now, at long last,⟪k:1⟫come to understand just what kind of man "
"Jacopo was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sento come se, dopo tanto tempo, io sia riuscita finalmente a capire che tipo di persona "
"fosse Jacopo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_92DD5E58_656C_41CC_B352_6418C5733715
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50ba338b66725b6df7208e28605b9eae7abafcd19fd6fd230537b6f6e4449648
#. default-sha256: 02da5a62a8d4184564659d62a51edefddeb42cc2ea8082a53a0f7eb0b0f35979
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_92DD5E58_656C_41CC_B352_6418C5733715"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While he had a great deal of pride in his capabilities,⟪k:1⟫he had far less confidence in "
"himself as a person."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sebbene fosse molto orgoglioso delle proprie capacità, aveva molta meno fiducia in se stesso "
"come persona."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8B5731DA_FAA4_4F9A_9D09_516331D630E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f930254170a92690ab96120b4d8aa7557b8a5515e75989af08d2f08d5e92192
#. default-sha256: 1c006a4be96240aaf2ffce4353a5b238331c8d17260e4eced9b3f71f4671c18f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8B5731DA_FAA4_4F9A_9D09_516331D630E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If he’d had faith in himself, perhaps he could have put faith in his wife as well."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se l’avesse avuta, probabilmente avrebbe potuto fidarsi anche di sua moglie."

#: scenario3:scenario3_996E988B_CC27_45E8_9A67_223B48B8DA7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d09b03d5d7d3d5b2c30377c309efe0f6f74c7b1ee7728df2d448ea86bcfffe78
#. default-sha256: d22570c82003c54c721e4542b051ac83e56aa0fcb9b6a693851ada4eb6aa5aa5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_996E988B_CC27_45E8_9A67_223B48B8DA7D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had his pride not been so twisted, perhaps he would not have been so afraid of being hurt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se il suo orgoglio non fosse stato tanto viscerale, forse non avrebbe avuto così tanta paura "
"di essere ferito."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5DF31479_AE4D_47D3_9E22_F2AB4CCB1D45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11a0a54a4f052cbdaf7e514eaf2c451c27ac073d2c31b0c90915b641d72b3eb1
#. default-sha256: bb3c1427c1c4a5ae8cca11ec6564ca6654b775548d4a00f09051fea96e7a6343
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5DF31479_AE4D_47D3_9E22_F2AB4CCB1D45"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Indeed, he was afraid. ⟪k:1⟫Afraid of being rejected by her. ⟪k:2⟫Afraid to face a reality "
"where his beloved partner scorned him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Già, aveva paura. ⟪k:1⟫Paura di essere respinto da lei. ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Di affrontare una realtà "
"in cui la sua amata lo ridicolizzava."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9D8604A1_08B8_4080_A485_47F651DB92D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a23c1a1676215aaf50ef8465a94f5459be0467bb714287d983de534c8315b0ea
#. default-sha256: 4699df80ee61fe3ffcfdd952e75def16af0441ee9510734300fab308a227c7e5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9D8604A1_08B8_4080_A485_47F651DB92D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Where the woman he loved laughed at him disdainfully. ⟪k:1⟫Where she and countless others "
"mocked him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Una realtà in cui la donna che amava lo derideva con disprezzo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in cui lei e molti "
"altri lo prendevano in giro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9990F753_29BB_42C7_B5B6_30DF42842E92
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 728266aeec5ac511ab19ef6ae37ebcf9c80fd9c5b14645e6d54a479e0647af98
#. default-sha256: 3b605d392464b049cc177bfa495c7a38ee227bc0febc9755c0e0c5c621a6b06e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9990F753_29BB_42C7_B5B6_30DF42842E92"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The thought of it paralyzed him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il solo pensiero lo paralizzava."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AF3D5FD7_689B_4584_97BD_E11E0CA4850E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83d43768e4e98c19c44d3e6197582d807539ca50e61360cbc98797d94f57381f
#. default-sha256: d2bab036a9a2cbfda8a81402d4bdf92093ea4d21a00f68b7188d0af6e50d27ae
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AF3D5FD7_689B_4584_97BD_E11E0CA4850E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The environment in which he had been raised played a significant part in his state of mind, "
"I expect."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Immagino che l’ambiente in cui era cresciuto avesse giocato un ruolo importante nel suo "
"stato mentale."

#: scenario3:scenario3_07A83A0C_6C2D_4683_8E9F_FA0A89328402
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e70ec1b82f969ff14442b0ba982f7495089e8d32da562586949fe540b3ad6e23
#. default-sha256: 8508d4a58f3bd383778c7bb19f6e5be647df245b134d9b2fdab3e35fa61142dc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_07A83A0C_6C2D_4683_8E9F_FA0A89328402"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Occasionally, the name on the letter would change.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maria was making the White-"
"Haired Girl out to be having affairs with multiple other men."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ogni tanto, il nome sulla lettera cambiava.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maria stava facendo uscire la Ragazza "
"dai Capelli Bianchi con diversi uomini."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A45E1A2B_7E31_4F08_A830_BA8B1F55B6A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cd0d27e324f349312d222dc978dd26ddab27c6fd2bace63f20dee3ca4346803
#. default-sha256: cf2a4f1be2bb691c60b411eb0c4c63a03fcbec0210aaa01a695a98d0d3996df2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A45E1A2B_7E31_4F08_A830_BA8B1F55B6A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She could never do any such thing, of course."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sua moglie non avrebbe mai potuto fare nulla di simile, ovviamente."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CF09187E_FDCF_423D_8B2C_E7DC2200258D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99eb293d835191584738d3b470c52f5fc172d76b7cddbfa18a29320161a005e8
#. default-sha256: 288849a8ed34db2a7ddf601f533add952c513167fcaa176aca5ccac124be8348
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CF09187E_FDCF_423D_8B2C_E7DC2200258D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But Jacopo, thinking Maria to be his only ally, believed everything she said."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma Jacopo, convinto che Maria fosse sua alleata,⟪k:1⟫credeva ad ogni sua singola parola."

#: scenario3:scenario3_85F9856C_822E_4A4C_A693_C23F84D440E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dea92f4343f27fa88756cced892170cdd05adfdb63d5767dab2cdb2629bfc5f0
