msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫There’s a limit to what we can accomplish on this tiny island."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫C’è un limite a ciò che possiamo ottenere in questa piccola isola."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BDBF994F_ED58_4460_9E56_8E6B499A8686
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9502ee618ae8af127cd11f18fd696b30ec259a30fc22afc06e422d227e3102d
