msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E15B489D_0B69_461A_B199_9684A706F593"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And not just this family—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫this whole land will find itself famished and "
"emaciated,⟪k:4⟫defenseless against invasion as we waste away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E non solo la nostra famiglia—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫questa intera isola si ritroverà affamata e "
"indebolita,⟪k:4⟫indifesa contro le invasioni mentre noi invecchiamo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_70394F97_AF80_441D_A21F_27E2FB78144D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a890513322778be66c8752e3568788861184feba00a47d71de061fa15a8fa1b2
