msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫the previous capofamiglia was an incredibly reticent man.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It took all he had to "
"merely preserve his small chunk of the world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫è stata l’incredibile riluttanza del precedente capofamiglia.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ha perso tutto nel "
"tentativo di preservare il suo piccolo pezzo di terra."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2BC07195_7C3E_449C_915B_F852039EB9AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58f8dfa6a98f312d30312a2d9875e12ae2522770ed45ca66c7976d79915b416e
