msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I’m not like that, and neither are you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma io non sono come lui, e neanche tu."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FEEF46E6_EE48_4E2E_983C_56E1D75D3CF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
