msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We need the Bearzatti name climbing the social ladder in short order or we’re going to have "
"everything ripped out from under us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Abbiamo bisogno che il nome dei Bearzatti risalga la scala sociale⟪k:1⟫il prima possibile, o "
"ci verrà strappata ogni cosa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_826F0D3F_4803_453B_ACD8_C19823B199D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e602be3995fce9426c954747203adcf4883d1f4b15c05d63340a592aae6a1eb
