msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If the woman isn’t to your liking,⟪k:1⟫you can find another one that is.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫She’s only "
"going to be your wife in name."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se la donna non ti piace,⟪k:1⟫puoi cercarne un’altra.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sarà tua moglie solo di nome."

#: scenario3:scenario3_725E7DF5_A653_4B90_AD65_C2F703EF57FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 590481b6b09699773ad3aee8cc2bf3f8786188524bf2c990ff42ec561c7b64bc
