msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma ascoltami bene, figliolo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non devi permetterle⟪k:4⟫ di tradirti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_380FA7EE_6339_494D_91E6_60725FCAB712
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
