msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non devi permettere a ⟪k:1⟫nessuno⟪k:2⟫ di guardarti dall’alto in basso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_505C34D6_32C5_4383_B646_8B5C652DE41C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 402433c14030c502ccfce063b0f1f57ba4f8de524e00a0d9396580a6ab818925
